    "q-335213": {
      "dom_id": "step-q335213",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=-3x(t)+y(t)+5 \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=2x(t)+5y(t)-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of ODEs above. The equilibrium point of the system is $[2,\\,1]^{T}.$ Which of the following is the system obtained by shifting the equilibrium to the origin?",
      "worked_solution": "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]x+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhere $x=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$\n\nTo shift the system's equilibrium from ${x}^{∗}$ to the origin, we define the deviation vector\n\n$$\nu=x-{x}^{∗},\n$$\n\nwhere $u=[\\begin{aligned}u(t) \\\\ v(t)\\end{aligned}].$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\nu=x-[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,⇒\\,x=u+[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,\\text{and}\\,{x}^{′}={u}^{′}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x$ and ${x}^{′}$ into the given system, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′} & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]x+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {u}^{′} & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}](u+[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}])+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]u+[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]u+[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the shifted system is the following:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=-3u(t)+v(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)+5v(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-335213-a",
